  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of academic freedoms in higher learning institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will promote academic freedom in higher education in Zambia by combining research as a driver to promote critical thinking among students, and dialogue between students and education authorities and promote the decolonization of education. The projects seeks to promote advocacy of the increaced participation of female students, students with disabilities and low-income/rural youth.The program will also advocate for implementation of the loan and scholarship scheme.</narrative>
  </description>
